DRIFT|Be not loth to part with thy money on so good an account|The digitised CCEL source reads "grudge not a kindness to they brother" -- an obvious typographical error for "thy brother", which the book prints. Verified against ccel.org mhc1 Deuteronomy 2026-09-05.
